WEBVTT

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.240
100 yen bills are still in use,

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.910
but they'll be discontinued
 so be careful.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.740
How about pay phones?

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.790
Going to a new era is
 always straining work.

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:26.450
But don't worry.
 I know you'll carry through.

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:28.290
Super Jaguar.

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:33.800
Yes. I will eliminate those
 Free History Advocate criminals.

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:39.160
Whether you live or die, your body
 will come back here in one week.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.000
But to me, it'll only be 5 seconds.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:01.950
(The 25th century)

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:19.330
Concrete Revolutio
 ~Superhuman Phantasmagoria~

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:27.410
I heard it
 A voice cursing fate

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:31.580
I found it
 A way to use my power

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:35.490
What you want are not words,
 are they?

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:38.750
That love inside
 I want to send it on

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:41.580
Justice is not on my side

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:45.910
The only thing absolute for me
 is myself

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:48.540
Come on Wakers. Ready, go!

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:53.410
Protecting the illusions
 that somebody dreamed of

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:57.910
will liberate the stagnant sky

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:03.580
We hurl our unanswerable cries
 at each other

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:08.410
And they become the reason we live

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:14.610
What can I do in this
 hopeless world we live in?

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:19.200
Only those that keep searching

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:22.080
can become the future

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:26.040
Start the revolution!

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:34.380
(April, the 43rd of Shinka Era
 Northern Kanto area)

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.260
(The Shadow of Fate)

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:42.350
Release the hostages first,
 and we won't hurt you.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:47.640
I can hear it.
 He's really going to kill us.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:53.030
I can see it. He's got dynamite
 wrapped around his body.

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:58.160
Of course you can.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:02.410
You're superhumans with
 clairvoyant and mind-reading powers.

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.910
Why use the powers for fraud?

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:08.330
It's because they had them.

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:11.420
I hear lots of superhumans
 join gangs these days.

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:14.550
But we're going to
 save those two, right?

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:18.550
Right. They're poor hostages,
 and they're superhumans.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:23.770
They cheated me out of
 my store, my fortune, everything.

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:27.650
Superhumans saved me during the war.

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:31.690
But these two take
 normal humans for fools.

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:34.690
I don't want that old man
 to get hurt.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.690
Don't feel like it's your fault.

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:53.750
Mr. Jaguar?

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.340
Raise your head and stuff, Equus!

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:59.960
Try as you like,
 but it'll only move for Jiro.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.590
That's ghost discrimination.
 I'll riot!

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.610
So what's up with Jiro?

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.850
He's feeling sorry for the old man.

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:16.730
What a brat.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:19.990
Do you hate Hitoyoshi, Mr. Jaguar?

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:22.990
I hate all kids.

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:26.740
But you made a machine just for him.

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:31.370
Isn't it a bit childish?

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:34.500
Really?

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:45.090
Do you need arms and legs to
 fight Grosse Augen types?

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:48.850
It'll be easier for the boy
 to fight with.

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:52.230
He's a part of the machine
 and the machine itself.

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.480
Boys will always be boys.

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:57.480
- What?
 - They love their toys.

00:04:57.740 --> 00:04:59.860
Especially those that act grown up.

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:02.690
Thank you, Hyouma Senpai.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.500
You are Mr. Jaguar, right?

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:14.960
Hoshino?

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.340
Um...

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.670
What the heck is that?

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:31.390
Mari, Nana, blast off.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:36.730
Roger. The police are just watching.
 How pitiful.

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:40.230
Be it superhuman or human,
 evil will perish.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:41.990
Right, Akira?

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:44.990
IQ. Go.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.830
Japan's police force had those?

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:55.200
- It's IQ.
 - IQ?

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.750
It goes by Infernal Queen.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:01.710
That's the organization doing
 worldwide assassinations.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:05.510
Be it politicians or rebels,

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:10.310
they eliminate anything
 they deem as evil.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:23.360
We're doing the dirty work for you
 since you let criminals run wild.

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:25.360
Your reasons matter not.

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:28.860
The moment you took hostages
 and shut yourself in,

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:29.910
you became evil.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:41.080
Who said you could move?

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:44.170
You're going to kill us too?

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.720
Wow.

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:56.020
The criminal and the scamming
 superhumans both evaporated.

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:58.810
Makes you feel stupid for hesitating.

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:04.110
They've wreaked havoc
 up and down the Americas.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:08.240
The laws won't let
 the Self-Defense Force move.

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:22.800
Crew of IQ.

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:24.760
Mission accomplished.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.470
Good job, everyone.

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:30.630
I thought we were
 going to do Japan later.

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:35.270
In the conquest of creating a free
 history, a new enemy has appeared.

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:37.390
Its name is the Superhuman Bureau.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:40.150
The Superhuman Bureau?

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.230
Heard of them, Akira?

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:47.480
A Health and Welfare Ministry
 sub-division I think.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:53.660
Morning.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:54.910
Yoshimura.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:58.410
That's rare. Chief and Hoshino?

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.540
About the other day.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:03.250
You mean the Infernal Queen? I...

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:06.790
Hyouma Yoshimura.
 Let's talk, as you're with the IQ.

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:08.960
- Hitoyoshi?
 - Senpai?

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:11.600
Don't move.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:24.780
Is that it?

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:41.250
What?

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:45.040
You know
 the National Public Security Force?

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:48.050
An anti-superhumans unit
 under the cabinet.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:51.840
The guys that were powerless
 against the Tartaros Bugmen.

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.890
I'm Shakko, the captain.

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:58.020
You guys hate our Bureau

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:01.140
because we won't show
 our superhuman records.

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:03.110
What's this harassment for?

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:07.690
We contacted superhuman institutes
 of several countries to research IQ.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:10.320
Who are IQ?

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:13.410
Brutal criminals that
 trouble the police.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:17.160
They target extralegal beings like
 heads of states and military people.

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:20.330
Once they deem someone evil,
 they kill without trial.

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.700
Criminals claiming to be justice.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.420
They killed a politician in the U.S.

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:29.800
IQ has enhanced a technology called
 Meteor Particle Contact.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:34.220
They hide their identity by instantly
 contacting any place on Earth.

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:37.470
But that's the US Navy's technology.

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:41.100
So the politician tried to keep
 the technology hidden.

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:45.650
IQ took that as concealing technology
 and deemed it evil.

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:47.270
Just like Earth-chan.

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.360
An army of them.

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:53.230
And we finally found out
 a few of the members.

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.830
Isn't this Mr. Jaguar?

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:04.250
But Mr. Jaguar was with us
 yesterday when we...

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:06.750
This is absurd. It's a fake photo.

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:08.960
I don't mean to hide it.

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:10.960
That's me in the picture.

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:14.960
- Mr. Jaguar?
 - You mean you've infiltrated them?

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:18.390
He can practically stop time.

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:19.470
He used that power...

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:21.890
I expected that explanation.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:25.220
But if you helped with murder,
 that history cannot change.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.980
You're right. I agree with you.

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:33.990
Meteortail!

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.960
Hoshino. What are you doing?

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:53.090
Um, Mr. Jaguar. Where are you going?

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.960
Just like Shakko said.
 You can't erase the past.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.640
Does that mean...?

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:06.470
Is it about him?

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:11.820
This girl is a witch.
 You're the future me, right?

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:13.070
Help me.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.110
Where'd you find him?

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:16.860
Yesterday by the river.

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:19.910
How did you know it wasn't me?

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.580
Because...

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:24.120
I've never seen this before.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:26.870
Oh, that's my friend Ullr.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.500
I know. I've seen you two speak.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:34.630
You learned at Police Academy.
 Nobody carries those around yet.

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:38.300
I know how you feel though.
 I was like that too.

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:40.050
Well, you are me, but.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:41.380
Police Academy?

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:45.470
The History Police.
 Better known as Time Patrol.

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:49.890
Why are you disguised as Mr. Jaguar?

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:54.520
I'm Super Jaguar. A History Restoring
 Police from the 25th century.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.320
Super?

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:59.320
I'm after future dwellers
 trying to change history.

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:03.160
Wait, is another one of me
 already in this era?

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:08.120
I used to work for the Time Patrol.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:13.420
I deserted it thinking I could make
 a better future by changing history.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.750
I created IQ.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.710
You started IQ?

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:19.840
There are no superhumans in my era.

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:22.510
All possibilities of superhumans
 are gone.

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:25.770
I tried to change that future.

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:31.600
But I was stopped by myself
 as a Time Patrol.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:36.610
If I killed him,
 I would disappear too.

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.940
It's the "Grandfather Paradox."

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:44.410
So I went back in history
 to change how I did it.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:47.410
To protect and supervise superhumans.

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:49.460
The Superhuman Bureau.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:53.540
In other words, you're living
 in this era 3 times.

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:56.960
As a Time Patrol, as a member of IQ...

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.710
And now.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:02.090
Time never goes back to 0.

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:05.890
We'll rewrite on a new sheet,

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:08.100
but the original time
 is still under it.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:11.600
So IQ hadn't disappeared.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:16.440
Is the Superhuman Bureau evil
 according to the Mr. Jaguar in IQ?

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:21.110
They came, believing that the Bureau
 deprives superhumans' freedom.

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:25.200
So the IQ I created can destroy
 the Bureau I created.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:29.120
He can only stay in this era
 for a week.

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:32.370
He'll be gone tomorrow
 so just let him be.

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.790
You! I mean, me.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.080
You plan to kill yourself in IQ?

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:42.470
For the existence of the Bureau,
 the you of the past is in the way.

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:46.220
But what will happen to
 the current Mr. Jaguar?

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:51.520
Say a future dweller goes back and
 kills the monkeys that evolve into us.

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:55.230
Would all mankind disappear then?

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:59.360
But that future dweller evolved
 from those monkeys.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.400
That's how mankind started.

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:04.030
- So, um...
 - The answer is no.

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:08.370
When a great paradox is created,
 time ignores it.

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:11.200
But I'm not important enough.

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.120
You mean you'll disappear?

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.880
I knew this day would come.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.380
Ever since I made the Bureau.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:23.590
Take care of the future for me.
 Hope it's better.

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:28.130
Mr. Jaguar.

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:32.890
I didn't know you cared
 so much about superhumans.

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:36.940
Adding animal traits to humans

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:40.650
or making animals evolve human-like.

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:42.190
Which is more tame?

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:46.360
There are no superhumans
 in our future.

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:47.740
In other words, we're...

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:52.200
Mr. Jaguar!

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.170
What is it, Hoshinoko?

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:02.920
Hey, what the...?

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.000
Only we can handle that.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.140
What are you doing, Hoshinoko?

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:13.850
It's clear that you're hiding
 the crimes of bad superhumans.

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:18.060
Well, I guess he's right.

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:19.640
Sadly, yes.

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.770
Isn't this Mr. Jaguar?

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:26.110
You said he was infiltrating them.

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:29.070
We are here to bring justice to you.

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:37.370
Darn them.

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:40.910
Governmental slaves. They're
 protecting the criminal Bureau.

00:15:56.770 --> 00:16:00.230
I agree that the Bureau is
 a nest of criminal superhumans.

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:01.890
But you guys go first.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.280
Do you really think it's him?

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:12.410
You're right.
 I can't tell what he's thinking.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.830
Raise your head, Equus!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.210
From below?

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:44.730
Is it really you, Mr. Jaguar?

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:46.780
Jaguar?

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:48.980
How does he know my old nickname?

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:52.780
I wouldn't be surprised
 if you really were IQ.

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:56.830
Evil is unforgivable.
 Be it superhuman or human.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:58.540
But...

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:02.880
Will the world become clean
 just by eliminating it all?

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:05.750
You're still a child.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:07.710
I can tell by your machine.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:10.590
Are limbs and heads
 necessary for fighting?

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:13.890
They just consume energy
 and throw you off balance.

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:18.350
Weapons just need to destroy targets
 from a safe distance.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:31.480
It's more effective than using fists.

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:35.870
You're nothing but a kid
 if you still want to look like that.

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:37.360
You can't understand me.

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.130
Senpai...

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.590
But you're the one that gave me this.

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:54.340
That's why...

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:55.390
Emi!

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:11.400
Even if it is childish, I...

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.130
Hang in there.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:38.470
Gotta call for backup
 with Meteor Particle.

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:44.430
What the...?

00:18:51.570 --> 00:18:54.360
Time Patrol. Me from the past, huh?

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:57.360
No, I'm from a little later than you.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:59.400
I knew this was coming.

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:00.860
You knew?

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:03.950
That machine, Equus. I made it.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:06.620
After this IQ Ship.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:09.500
So it's stronger than this.

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:25.520
Do you know what this means?

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:28.100
If I die, you'll...

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.650
Probably disappear.

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:31.980
But I feel relieved.

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:34.070
What?

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:40.990
We were so close to changing history.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:44.830
And to do that,
 we chose to eliminate evil people.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:49.040
The way cool, emotionless
 adults would do it.

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.880
But is that true?

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.380
Will defeating evil change the world?

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:59.050
Isn't that just an embarrassingly
 childish dream?

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:02.510
Such a mortifying past...

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:04.970
You wanted to erase it.

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:08.390
That's how adults are, right?

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:35.800
I'm not disappearing.
 I killed the past me.

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:38.090
But then, why?

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:02.940
Are you okay?
 You're not transparent, are you?

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:06.450
I'm so relieved.
 You didn't disappear after all.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:09.450
Did you do something?

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:13.830
I showed the Time Patrol watch
 to Prof. Hitoyoshi.

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:18.670
He believed that
 it came from the future.

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:24.970
He said it'd take time but this will
 unravel the theory of time traveling.

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:30.560
Research on time traveling will start
 because of my watch

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:35.940
But that watch was created
 as a result of that research.

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:39.990
Yes, it's a paradox.
 The chicken or the egg, right?

00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:43.410
You became an unsolvable paradox.

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:49.570
I became
 an indispensable existence to time.

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:55.040
But I don't think you would've
 disappeared even if I didn't do this.

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:59.170
You said yourself that
 history doesn't disappear.

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:01.590
That more things are added over it.

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:03.300
That's why.

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:07.090
I can't make the past disappear.

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:11.640
Just talking to myself.

00:23:46.070 --> 00:23:47.990
Welcome back, Super Jaguar.

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:49.910
I have a question.

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:53.780
Is the current me called a superhuman?

00:23:56.660 --> 00:23:58.500
I'm Jackie,
 the vocals for Angel Stars,

00:23:58.540 --> 00:24:00.710
the Japanese government
 recognized band.

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:03.830
It's not cool to hide
 that you're superhuman.

00:24:03.830 --> 00:24:07.630
I'll deliver the youth's voice
 with an electric sound.

00:24:07.630 --> 00:24:09.550
If you felt that, you're
 a superhuman too.

00:24:09.590 --> 00:24:10.800
Love and peace!
